silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_02_chunking_hashing_concrete_anchor#chunkinghashingsymbol silm:hasLongDescription "The ChunkingHashingSymbol is The content hash of the Mittens vet-record chunk: sha256(vet-record-payload) = sha256:7f4a...bf2c. This hash uniquely identifies the payload, enables content-addressed retrieval, and serves as the witness annotation on the materialization arrow mu_Mittens." .
